  _pages:
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7bae6ea8dcbb0de4592bc10473508c99, type: 3}
    Title: Skill Points (SP)
    Body: "The SP bar at the top left stores your power.\r\nFill it to 10 to enter Special mode \u2014 your gun fires a powerful cursed shot.\r\nA cursed shot uses all of your SP."
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7bae6ea8dcbb0de4592bc10473508c99, type: 3}
    Title: Gaining SP
    Body: 'Fight to build SP:

      - Melee attacks: gain SP slowly.

      - Parry: press {F} right before a hit lands to gain SP fast.

      - Glory Kill: when an enemy is open, press {E} for a huge SP boost.'
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7bae6ea8dcbb0de4592bc10473508c99, type: 3}
    Title: Losing SP
    Body: 'Unused SP starts draining after 10 seconds (1 SP per second).

      Firing a normal shot resets SP to zero.

      Saving SP? Hold off on normal shots until you can fire a cursed shot.'
  _closeKey: 0
  _closeLabel: 
